='run--5371beec-1bdc-4c04-833f-e7c12e48988e-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2593, 'output_tokens': 2701, 'total_tokens': 5294} 53%|█████▎    | 53/100 [2:04:59<3:26:57, 264.20s/it]
