Task 3: Place nginx.conf  
Description Task 3: Deploy the nginx.conf template from nginx.conf.j2 to /etc/nginx/nginx.conf with mode 0644, validate using 'nginx -t -c %s', and notify the 'Restart nginx' handler.  

Task 4: Ensure /etc/nginx/conf.d exists  
Description Task 4: Ensure the directory /etc/nginx/conf.d exists using ansible.builtin.file with state: directory and mode 0755.  

Task 5: Place default.conf  
Description Task 5: Deploy the default.conf template from default.conf.j2 to /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf with mode 0644 and notify the 'Restart nginx' handler.  

